 "notes": "Seated variant of perch_sit (take v4_a): from the ledge pose she lifts her hands, leans in squeezing her arms for cleavage, points, gives one slow hooked beckon, points again, then settles back with a weighty chest bounce (~5.5 s); whole 7 s video (first = last = base_clean still). Built at scale 0.559 so the body matches perch_sit size (the base_clean still is ~0.89x the perch_sit_base still), then shifted up 16 px so the hands-on-edge seat line matches perch_sit (seat_y 240). deshadow.py rows 150-272 (little to remove), QA --fix (177 fringe px). Seat values measured like perch_sit on the built frames (alpha > 128): seat_y = lowest row in y 180-300 whose opaque span is >= 80% of the widest span, on the hands-on-ledge frames 0-5 and 78-83 (240 on 11 of 12, 241 on one); seat_x_range = opaque run containing x=200 on rows 232/236/240 over all frames, p5 left / p95 right = [155, 236]; feet_lowest_y = max lowest opaque row = 375. Known minor flaw: her left hand (viewer right) fuses a little while resting at ~2.5-5.0 s; left as is.",
